# Donezo
> "The secret of getting ahead is getting started." - Mark Twain [(Source)](https://www.reddit.com/r/quotes/comments/1181xaq/the_secret_of_getting_ahead_is_getting_started/?rdt=59982)

This Donezo Bot is your all in one bot to help you get ahead in life! It's:
- text-based
- easy to learn
- ~~FAST~~ SUPER FAST to use

All you need to do is:
1. Download this from [here.](https://github.com/JuhromeAlexander/ip/releases/tag/A-Jar)
2. Open up your terminal and head to where you downloaded it
3. Run the following command:
```bash
java -jar "Donezo.jar"
```
4. Explore the application! 😄 

And it is **FREE**!

Features:
- [x] Managing Tasks
- [x] Managing Deadlines
- [x] Managing Events

If you are a Java Programmer, you can use it to practice Java too. Here's the ```main``` method:
```java
public static void main(String[] args) {
        Donezo donezo = new Donezo();
        try {
            donezo.run();
        } catch (DonezoException e) {
            System.out.println(e);
        }
    }
```

